  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1808.02 Asbestos Abatement Entity and Personnel",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1808.02 Asbestos Abatement Entity and Personnel.\n\n(a) The owner or operator shall ensure that the asbestos abatement entity and personnel involved in a major asbestos abatement are licensed and certified, respectively, in accordance with Env-A 1815 and Env-A 1816.\n\n(b) Prior to performing any of the activities described in Env-A 1808.03 through 1808.05, any asbestos abatement entity or personnel involved in major asbestos abatement shall be licensed or certified pursuant to Env-A 1815 and Env-A 1816.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1, Revision Note #2, and Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Env-A 1800) #14104, eff 11-1-24, EXPIRES: 11-1-34",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a1800.html"
